\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 Elan tam kontrol\'fcmde olan H\'fcrm\'fcz Bo\'f0az\'fdn\'fdn ad\'fdn\'fd TRUMP BO\'d0AZI, Ontario G\'f6l\'fcn\'fcn ad\'fdn\'fd da ABD G\'d6L\'dc olarak de\'f0i\'fetiriyorum. Te\'feekk\'fcrler. \b Ba\'fekan DONALD J.TRUMP (truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump)\b0\par
